ducts; and naval services, surface vessels, and submarines. It serves automotive, chemicals, energy generation and distribution, food and beverages, white goods, aerospace, mechanical and plant engineering, oil and gas, shipbuilding, and special vehicles, as well as construction, infrastructure, and buildings industries. The company was founded in 1811 and is headquartered in Essen, Germany.","url":"https://eodhd.com/financial-apis/stock-etfs-fundamental-data-feeds/","filed":"2026-10-02","section":"Company description"}],"basis":"computed","chart":{"label":"Gross margin","unit":"percent","points":[[2016,0.16875939179380078],[2017,0.16792530219316235],[2018,0.14176035885786584],[2019,0.1381051027454342],[2020,-0.009896878676725033],[2021,0.12808678269049859],[2022,0.13760330578512397],[2023,0.07078726521912881],[2024,0.09254872863217374],[2025,0.11325638761153577]]}},{"question":2,"answer":"Margins ranged from 7.1% to 11.3% during 2023–25; it earns 4.7% on its capital.","evidence":[{"quote":"FY2023: grossProfit / revenue = 7.1%.","url":"https://eodhd.com/financial-apis/stock-etfs-fundamental-data-feeds/","filed":"2026-10-01T09:07:14.569Z","section":"Calculated from annual statements"},{"quote":"FY2024: grossProfit / revenue = 9.3%.","url":"https://eodhd.com/financial-apis/stock-etfs-fundamental-data-feeds/","filed":"2026-10-01T09:07:14.569Z","section":"Calculated from annual statements"},{"quote":"FY2025: grossProfit / revenue = 11.3%.","url":"https://eodhd.com/financial-apis/stock-etfs-fundamental-data-feeds/","filed":"2026-10-01T09:07:14.569Z","section":"Calculated from annual statements"},{"quote":"10-year return on capital observations [[2016,0.42578890097932537],[2017,0.7015873015873015],[2018,0.18382264829239064],[2019,0.06289808917197452],[2020,-1.4544627231361569],[2021,0.03097128894318876],[2022,0.12160795605458377],[2023,-0.18801535445932702],[2024,-0.2215727391874181],[2025,-0.10891396332863187]]; median 0.04693468905758164. ROIC follows the displayed moat